WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:02.480
I said

00:02.800 --> 00:04.467
Only talk about family matters

00:09.760 --> 00:11.427
I just miss your sister

00:19.040 --> 00:20.440
Your Majesty's family matters

00:20.520 --> 00:21.920
Are state matters

00:22.040 --> 00:23.720
Your Majesty is now of priceless worth

00:23.800 --> 00:25.520
Can still remember sister's affection

00:25.880 --> 00:27.200
I

00:27.280 --> 00:28.680
Am deeply grateful

00:38.040 --> 00:39.200
My sister

00:39.280 --> 00:41.280
Was the family's treasure since childhood

00:42.000 --> 00:43.120
The elders

00:43.200 --> 00:45.040
All praised her cleverness and gentleness

00:45.120 --> 00:46.520
Unaware of affairs

00:46.720 --> 00:47.800
But actually my sister

00:47.960 --> 00:49.200
Was thoughtful

00:49.280 --> 00:50.680
And had strong opinions

00:51.240 --> 00:52.120
When I was young

00:52.200 --> 00:53.680
I often got into trouble

00:53.760 --> 00:55.560
When I couldn't cover it up

00:55.640 --> 00:57.280
I'd go beg my sister

00:57.360 --> 00:58.000
My sister

00:58.080 --> 01:00.080
Could always fix it for me
